D('hit',{extraExamples:[ex(1,'The batter hit the ball into the far corner of the field.','击球手把球打到了场地远端的角落。'),ex(2,'A delivery van hit the gate while reversing.','一辆送货车倒车时撞上了大门。'),ex(3,'The region was hit by severe flooding after the snow melted.','积雪融化后，该地区遭遇了严重洪灾。'),ex(4,'It suddenly hit me that I had left the key inside.','我突然想起钥匙落在里面了。'),ex(5,'Their first single became a hit across several countries.','他们的首支单曲风靡多个国家。')],mistakes:[m('grammar','The ball hitted the window during practice.','The ball hit the window during practice.','hit 的过去式和过去分词仍是 hit，不是 hitted。')],quiz:[q('hit',1,1,'The player hit the ball with a bat. The player _____.','struck it forcefully','caught it without touching it','painted it','动词 hit 的基本义是击打。'),q('hit',2,2,'The car hit a wall means the car _____.','collided with the wall','avoided the wall','was parked beside it','hit 可表示撞上某物。'),q('hit',3,3,'A drought hit the farms. The farms _____.','were badly affected','received a delivery','were praised for success','灾害 hit 某地，表示侵袭或造成严重影响。'),q('hit',4,4,'“It hit me that I knew her” means _____.','I suddenly realized it','I physically struck her','I forgot her name','it hit me 可表示某事突然被想起或领悟。')]});
D('hit back',{extraExamples:[ex(1,'When the review accused the clinic of hiding data, its director hit back with the full audit.','评论指责诊所隐瞒数据后，主任拿出完整审计报告予以回击。')],mistakes:[m('grammar','She hit back to the accusation with a public letter.','She hit back at the accusation with a public letter.','表示反击某人的批评时通常用 hit back at，而不是 hit back to。')],quiz:[q('hit back',1,1,'A boxer hit back after being struck. The boxer _____.','returned a blow','left the ring before the match','asked for a scorecard','hit back 可表示受到攻击后回击。'),q('hit back',2,1,'A company hit back at its critics with evidence. It _____.','responded forcefully to their criticism','agreed with every complaint','stopped producing evidence','hit back at 也可比喻强硬回应批评。'),q('hit back',3,1,'Choose the idiomatic preposition: “They hit back ___ the allegations.”','at','on','by','该短语常说 hit back at criticism or allegations。'),q('hit back',4,1,'Which situation best fits hit back?','A team answers an attack with a counterattack.','A team quietly accepts every attack.','A team wins without anyone challenging it.','hit back 表示对攻击或批评作出回击。')]});
