D('hook',{extraExamples:[ex(1,'The gardener hung her gloves on a hook beside the shed door.','园丁把手套挂在棚门旁的挂钩上。'),ex(2,'The trout escaped after the hook slipped from its mouth.','鱼钩从鳟鱼嘴里滑脱后，它逃走了。'),ex(3,'He hooked the ladder over the roof edge before climbing.','爬上去前，他把梯子钩挂在屋檐边。'),ex(4,'The first episode hooked viewers with an unanswered mystery.','第一集用一个未解之谜吸引住了观众。'),ex(5,'The boxer landed a left hook in the final round.','拳击手在最后一回合打出了一记左钩拳。')],mistakes:[m('grammar','She hung her coat on a hookeds by the door.','She hung her coat on a hook by the door.','挂钩名词是 hook，不是 hookeds；此处也不需要过去分词。')],quiz:[q('hook',1,1,'A coat hook is a curved object used to _____.','hang clothes on','cut wood with','measure a wall','hook 作名词可指挂物的钩。'),q('hook',2,2,'A fish takes the hook when it _____.','bites or catches the fishing hook','swims past the boat','eats the fishing line’s label','hook 也可指带倒刺的鱼钩。'),q('hook',3,3,'A strong opening scene hooked the audience. It _____.','attracted and held their interest','made them leave immediately','taught them how to fish','动词 hook 可表示吸引住注意力。'),q('hook',4,5,'A boxer’s hook is a _____.','short curved punch','straight kick','defensive head guard','拳击术语 hook 指弧线出拳的钩拳。')]});
